## 1. Task List

These tasks execute the approved design; the PRD remains the acceptance source. Evidence files named below are planned outputs beneath this run's artefact directory, not completed checks. The implementing agent owns execution and cooperative reviews; Arndt Gold retains human approval and actual UAT authority. No delegation is required.

