T-002 through T-005 deliver only the minimal trusted resource/read/bridge path needed for T-006. They must not expand into full graph navigation or complete handoff UI before host feasibility is known. T-006 probes use clearly labelled bounded test data for context/message method feasibility; these probes do not substitute for production packet semantics or the final AC-006 journey. A question is sent only through a deliberate interactive action. Missing context/message/render usability or unavailable host activation leaves the embedded journey unqualified: stop dependent feature work, record the exact gap and route the earliest affected design/evidence owner. Do not substitute versions, host aliases, browser success or a manual bridge to bypass this checkpoint.

